# Postfix transport map (postmap'd at container start by the entrypoint).
#
# The `virtual` alias map rewrites  orgsync@untrobotics.com  ->
# orgsync@orgsync-ingest.local  (an internal pseudo-domain that is neither a
# virtual-alias domain nor a mydestination, so it isn't forwarded to Gmail and
# isn't a final local mailbox). This map then routes that pseudo-domain to the
# `orgsync-pipe` delivery service defined in master.cf, which pipes the message
# into orgsync-ingest.py.
orgsync-ingest.local   orgsync-pipe:
